  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Ask and route",
      "items": [
        "Spring Security validates the Keycloak JWT; RateLimitFilter caps chat and approval calls per user",
        "The input guardrail runs before the run starts; blocked messages never reach the model",
        "SpecialistRouter picks a specialist and records a HANDOFF step"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Approval gate",
      "items": [
        "create_ticket is @RequiresApproval: the turn is saved in Postgres and the run waits as AWAITING_APPROVAL",
        "After commit, reviewers get an e-mail (Mailpit in dev) and a live approvals badge",
        "A backend restart loses nothing; the paused run can still be approved"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Resume and finish",
      "items": [
        "The reviewer's decision resumes the same loop; the ticket is created and the requester notified",
        "The model writes the final answer, optionally revised by the self-check",
        "Output redaction runs before the run is stored as COMPLETED and streamed as done"
      ]
    }
  ]
